<title>UK: TABLE TENNIS-WALDNER WINS WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-WALDNER WINS WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan-Ove Waldner of Sweden won gold when defeating Vladimir Samsonov of Belarus in the men's singles final at the world table tennis championships on Monday.</p>
</text>
